# .env.example
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Template for your local .env file. This file IS committed to GitHub, so it
# must never contain a real key.
#
# How to use:
#   1. Copy this file to a new file named .env (in the same folder).
#   2. In .env, replace your-key-here with your real OpenAI API key.
#   3. Never share .env. It is listed in .gitignore, so Git will not upload it.
#
# When deployed on Streamlit Community Cloud, the key goes in the app's
# "Secrets" settings instead (see README.md), not in any file in the repo.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
OPENAI_API_KEY=your-key-here
